      "severity": "boundary",
      "statement": "Source versions have MSRV metadata (ring1.66, rustls/tokio1.71, pki1.60, zeroize1.85, rcgen/time1.88); workspace1.97 exceeds them. Native GNU/musl x86_64/aarch64 builds still need actual per-target CI. This review is not a new platform PASS."
